 "desc": "Commander of the mobile suit forces of the Federation's Londo Bell task force. He is a Federation Forces ace pilot who has endured many battles since the One Year War.\nHis age has given him calmness, and the dark side seen during the Gryps Conflict has now all but worn off.\nHe is also considerate and measured in his actions, and has high battle skills and good intuition. This has made him a much better MS pilot and person.\nHe has a strong animosity towards his rival Char Aznable, leader of the reborn Neo Zeon, but he has decided to put an end to it with this battle.",
